From 19879c91396cc42f4f9bfa7926b25b6ac08b41a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:05:28 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] fix(e2e): refuse in the new stubs what the daemon refuses

Review m1-m3. skills.toggle/plugins.toggle now require the daemon's
`enabled: bool` (an omitted or non-boolean value is -32602, as serde answers).
preview.start/status/stop keep the real per-project entry the manager keeps:
status and stop refuse a project with no preview with the daemon's own message,
a second start of a live preview is refused, and a stopped preview still
reports itself. runmode.set binds the struct the way serde does and applies
RunModeConfig::validate, answering serde's -32602 or the handler's -32000
instead of defaulting a malformed config.
